#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Graph.Graph:4
msgid "**Type** (:class:`ButtonGroup <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.ButtonGroup.ButtonGroup>`) : Type de données à représenter (localisations ou suivi)."
msgstr "**Type** (:class:`ButtonGroup <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.ButtonGroup.ButtonGroup>`) : Type of data to display (locations or tracking)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Graph.Graph:5
msgid "**Source** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : Source des données à représenter."
msgstr "**Source** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : Source of the data to be displayed."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Graph.Graph:6
msgid "**Dual** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Active la représentation de deux sources."
msgstr "**Dual** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Enables the display of two sources."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Graph.Graph:7
msgid "**Source B** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`) : Source secondaire des données à représenter."
msgstr "**Source B** (:class:`Combo <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.Combo.Combo>`): Secondary source of the data to be displayed."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Graph.Graph:8
msgid "**MSD Step** (:class:`SpinInt <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt>`) : Lors de la représentation du MSD, sélection de l'étape à représenter."
msgstr "**MSD Step** (:class:`SpinInt <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.SpinInt.SpinInt>`): When displaying the MSD, select the step to display."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.Graph.Graph:9
msgid "**Display** (:class:`GraphDisplay <palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay>`) : Options d'affichage du graphique."
msgstr "**Display** (:class:`GraphDisplay <palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay>`): Graph display options."

